WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:03.258
LOKI
Your savior is here!

00:00:03.283 --> 00:00:04.283
[Laughing]

00:00:05.352 --> 00:00:07.048
There is no stopping me.

00:00:09.790 --> 00:00:12.047
I'm a god, you dull creature.

00:00:13.404 --> 00:00:15.404
And I will not be bullied by-

00:00:16.568 --> 00:00:17.702
[Pained wheezing]

00:00:20.693 --> 00:00:21.813
When do we start?

